            <div xml:id="d720">

                <pb facs="0868" n="766" sameAs="frus:frus1927v03/pg766"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.672/539b: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the High Commissioner in Turkey</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bristol</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-01-18T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 18,
                                1927—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>9. The treaty failed of approval by the Senate, the vote being 50 for and 34
                    against.</p>
                <p>Be prepared to proceed to Angora immediately upon receipt of complete
                    instructions which are being telegraphed to you separately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
